                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "June is Men\u2019s Health Month. This year\u2019s theme \u2014 Closing the Empathy Gap in Men\u2019s Health \u2014 highlights the importance of addressing the unique health challenges facing men and encouraging them to seek early detection and treatment.\u00a0\n\nToo many men die of preventable health conditions, such as heart disease, cancer and suicide. Health care policy can help turn these trends around.\u00a0\n\nI joined @RepTroyCarter to anchor @TheBlackCaucus Special Order Hour on Men\u2019s Health Month and how cuts to Medicaid and our public health workforce threaten efforts to\u00a0improve men\u2019s health.",
